<title>BELGIUM: Audiofina 1996 profit up two pct.</title>
<headline>Audiofina 1996 profit up two pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(billions of Luxembourg francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit			     3.31  vs  3.23</p>
<p>    Cons net per share (francs)		 54  vs    53</p>
<p>    Gross dividend per share (francs)	 22  vs    21</p>
<p>NOTE - Media and financial holding company Compagnie Luxembourgeoise Audiofina said in a statement that the profit rise reflected a slight increase of the contribution by CLT and good results of management of its own finances.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
